==Overview==
The '''Military Rocket Launcher Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and both [[Abysmal Mode (Halloween Event)|Abysmal Mode]] events. Like all other enemies, it appears on [[Endless Mode]]. It has two rocket launchers that can be used to stun [[units]].

==Appearance==
The Military Rocket Launcher Toilet has a green camoflage pattern on its bowl and cistern. It has two rocket launchers connected to its toilet. Its skin is yellow, and its torso is blue like other toilets.
