==Trivia==
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Weaponized_Camo_Skibidi_Toilet Weaponized Camo Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
**The Weaponized Camo Skibidi Toilet is shown to have a hat, glasses, and buzzsaws in its appearance in the series. However, it was shot by the Camera Attack Helicopter in the first few seconds of the episode, losing its hat and glasses. This is why this enemy does not have them.
